{"severity":"error","file":"errors/codec_missing_1.march","start_line":20,"start_col":12,"end_line":20,"end_col":57,"message":"`Node.send` needs a JSON codec for `Ping`, and none is derived.\nhint: add `derive Json for Ping` next to its declaration; the compiler then mints the wire type tag from it, and a receiver decodes with `from_json`.","code":"codec_missing","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[]}
